Package: liftoff
Title: Program-Fit Analytics for a Collegiate Jumps Recruit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Roland", "Richard", , "roland.a.richard@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shows where an athlete's high jump and long jump marks would
    sit on NCAA Division I and II programs' performance lists, with an
    explicit coverage state for every program and event. Descriptive only:
    no blended scores and no predictions of coach behavior.
